Cider: CIDER_RENDER_SCALE=<f> reuses the Retina-mode machinery of winemac.drv with a factor below
1, so Windows sees a desktop f times smaller and macOS scales every window up. Games then render
fewer pixels (e.g. 1504x846 instead of 3008x1692 with f=2). Applies to wine-11.21.

